    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "The United States Federal Communications Commission has authorized SpaceX to deploy up to one million satellites for its Starmind space-based data center network.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-26:15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:05Z",
      "text": "The approval comes despite concerns about space debris and interference with astronomical objects.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-26:15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:11Z",
      "text": "The story is centered on the Federal Communications Commission in the United States, the body that granted the authorization.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-26:15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:19Z",
      "text": "The report comes from AFP.",
